1
00:00:00,319 --> 00:00:04,933
Your tasks — See what's yours, answer questions and move work along — anywhere.

2
00:00:05,889 --> 00:00:11,742
On a phone, Taskana opens on My work: your tasks by status, your hours banks, and what you reported.

3
00:00:12,349 --> 00:00:16,352
The menu button opens the pages: Inbox, the Board, all tasks, the Library and more.

4
00:00:21,169 --> 00:00:25,180
The Inbox: new assignments, mentions and questions for you.

5
00:00:30,015 --> 00:00:36,018
The Board scrolls sideways, one column at a time. To move a card, press and hold it — or use its Move menu.

6
00:00:39,095 --> 00:00:44,609
A task opens full screen: the description, checklist, comments and questions — and its status and dates.

7
00:00:47,249 --> 00:00:51,365
Your tasks, anywhere — More help: the Handbook → Taskana.
